      "writtenOn": "2019-10-10T01:41:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this will cause a race condition between the callback of handleImsFeatureCreatedCallback and setting this status callback. If the status callback is set after handleImsFeatureCreatedCallback is called, this event will be missed.\n\nI think it should be fine to always set the feature listeners and change capabilities during create. If it fails, that will indicate that the ImsService is no longer available. We have to make sure that we retry creating the interface the next time if accessing the ImsService causes a RemoteException.",
